        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Gu Immortal named Sang Qing Qu fights at Hei Fan grotto-heaven with theft path, narration states that there are few inheritances regarding the path.",
      "chapters": [
        1178
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "scarcity-of-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tu Shi Cheng places Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable as the creator of theft path in the Medieval Antiquity Era.",
      "chapters": [
        1323
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tu_shi_cheng",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "evt_era_medieval"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ling Hu Xu is a Western Desert demonic immortal who cultivates theft path, and a stretch of Western Desert conflict centers on him stealing a batch of soul cores during a chaotic battle.",
      "chapters": [
        2130
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ling_hu_xu",
        "reg_western_desert"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After exhausting dream realms, Fang Yuan lists theft path among his great grandmaster attainments.",
      "chapters": [
        2154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-attainment-limit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even after he completely comprehends the essence of killer moves like divine concealment and ghostly concealment through refinement path, the limitation of theft path attainment level still keeps him from modifying ghostly concealment yet.",
      "chapters": [
        2240
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-attainment-limit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable expended his own theft path dao marks to refine gamble Gu. He was an otherworldly demon with otherworldly dao marks: Thieving Heaven’s space was founded on those otherworldly dao marks, while gamble Gu was refined with his otherworldly theft path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        2201
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "thieving-heaven-primary",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_gamble_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable states that Thieving Heaven cultivates theft path primarily with space path as the secondary path, so that venerables with one main and one specialty path can compete on equal grounds.",
      "chapters": [
        2203
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "main-and-specialty-pairing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later stretch repeats that Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable cultivated theft path and space path under that same main-and-specialty pattern.",
      "chapters": [
        2204
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "main-and-specialty-pairing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
